. * ============================
. 
. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H2 * 
. /*To test H2, we will estimate the following linear regression model with plh
> 0308_v2 as outcome:
> 
> y_1i=α+βd_i+X_1i γ_1+X_2i γ_2+x_3i γ_3+ε_i              (1)
> 
> y_1i: Left leaning political preference (outcome variable)
> d_i: Dummy indicating whether parent i has only biological daughters
> X_1i: Vector of fixed effects for the birth year of the first child
> X_2i: Vector of fixed effects for the parent's birth year
> x_3i: Indicator for whether the parent has a migration background
> ε_i: Error term
> */
. 
.         * GENERATE FURTHER VARIABLES *
. gen     mh = inrange(migback,2,3)

. gen     plh0004_reversed = 10 - plh0004 

. 
.         
. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H2 * 
. regress plh0004_reversed d_daughter i.kidgeb01 i.gebjahr mh [pweight=phrf], v
> ce(cluster kidpnr01)
